  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Colaba Mumbai known for?",
      "answer": "Colaba is known as Mumbai's most iconic and cosmopolitan neighbourhood - home to the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel, the Gateway of India, Colaba Causeway's famous street market, Leopold Café, Sassoon Dock, the Afghan Church, Regal Cinema and some of the finest colonial-era architecture in Asia. It is Mumbai's most visited neighbourhood by tourists and one of its most beloved by residents."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Colaba?",
      "answer": "Colaba uses the pin code 400005 - shared with Cuffe Parade and one of South Mumbai's most prestigious postal codes."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Colaba?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Colaba are Colaba Causeway, Sassoon Dock, Afghan Church area, Regal Cinema belt, Colaba Woods, Navy Nagar (restricted), Wodehouse Road, Mandlik Road and the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel precinct near the Gateway of India."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Colaba?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Colaba are among Mumbai's highest. Sea-facing and heritage apartments near the Gateway of India range from ₹8–30 Cr. Colaba Causeway belt apartments range from ₹4–12 Cr for a 2BHK. Rental rates for 2BHKs range from ₹80,000–₹2.5 lakh per month depending on location and sea view (as of June 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Colaba?",
      "answer": "Colaba is served by the Churchgate railway station (Western Railway, 15 minutes by taxi), CST (Central Railway, 20 minutes), Metro Line 3 (Cuffe Parade station, 10 minutes by taxi), and BEST bus routes 1, 3, 6, 11 and 103. The area is also walkable to Fort and Nariman Point."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near Colaba?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals near Colaba include Bombay Hospital (Marine Lines), Breach Candy Hospital, Wockhardt Hospital, St. George's Hospital (Fort) and several specialist clinics within Colaba itself."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in or near Colaba?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in and near Colaba include Campion School (Cooperage), Cathedral & John Connon School (Fort), St. Xavier's High School (Fort), Navy Children School (Navy Nagar) and the Colaba Municipal School."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Colaba?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Colaba listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy to find the right dentist near Colaba Causeway, Regal Cinema or the Gateway of India."
    }
